1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,310
In this town, the monsters aren't
outside.

2
00:00:02,310 --> 00:00:04,017
I found that out the hard way.

3
00:00:04,017 --> 00:00:06,105
After that night, Mom started acting
strange.

4
00:00:06,105 --> 00:00:07,434
She never sleeps.

5
00:00:07,434 --> 00:00:10,025
And every night at 2:16, she stands in
the hallway...

6
00:00:10,025 --> 00:00:11,401
staring at my door.

7
00:00:11,851 --> 00:00:13,807
Then I found a note under my pillow.

8
00:00:13,807 --> 00:00:15,006
In my own handwriting.

9
00:00:15,006 --> 00:00:17,122
It said: Don't let her see you
looking.

10
00:00:17,722 --> 00:00:19,232
That night, I hid under my bed.

11
00:00:19,232 --> 00:00:21,372
The door creaked open.

12
00:00:21,372 --> 00:00:22,077
Footsteps.

13
00:00:22,077 --> 00:00:22,442
Then...

14
00:00:22,442 --> 00:00:22,981
silence.

15
00:00:24,581 --> 00:00:25,381
Three knocks.

16
00:00:25,381 --> 00:00:26,934
From inside my closet.

17
00:00:27,634 --> 00:00:28,374
Alex...

18
00:00:28,374 --> 00:00:29,329
it's me.

19
00:00:29,329 --> 00:00:30,644
Your real mom.

20
00:00:30,894 --> 00:00:32,424
It was the woman from the yard.

21
00:00:32,424 --> 00:00:34,644
She said they switched places at 2:17.

22
00:00:34,644 --> 00:00:36,110
And we had one minute left.

23
00:00:36,460 --> 00:00:37,585
We ran for the stairs.

24
00:00:37,585 --> 00:00:39,725
The thing in the hallway slowly turned
around.

25
00:00:39,725 --> 00:00:40,930
It had Mom's face...

26
00:00:40,930 --> 00:00:42,640
but its smile was way too wide.

27
00:00:42,640 --> 00:00:43,650
We made it outside.

28
00:00:43,650 --> 00:00:46,314
But every window on the street was
full of glowing eyes.

29
00:00:46,314 --> 00:00:46,923
Watching us.

30
00:00:47,373 --> 00:00:49,172
Then she squeezed my hand and
whispered...

31
00:00:49,322 --> 00:00:50,732
Whatever you do...

32
00:00:50,732 --> 00:00:53,174
don't look at your reflection.

33
00:00:54,124 --> 00:00:55,424
I looked down at the puddle.

34
00:00:55,424 --> 00:00:57,092
The boy in the reflection...

35
00:00:57,092 --> 00:00:57,622
wasn't me.

